        <div>
            <h2>About Games</h2>
            
            <p>Before you can use Gender Reveal Bingo Party, you'll need to purchase a game.</p>

            <p>Games can be purchased via the button below.</p>

            <p>$19.99 + tax</p>
            <a href="/purchase-game/checkout" class="button">Purchase a Game</a>

            <p>After purchasing a game, the game will appear in your account.</p>

            <img />

            <p>The following can be done through the <button>About Game</button> button:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Set the gender and title of the game.</li>
                <li>Create an edit link (allows doctors or friends to set the gender without creating an account).</li>
                <li>Download a copy of the winning card (if the game has been played).</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

